# Subject: what the change does, in the imperative, ≤72 characters.
#   "Add a --data flag for running without Outpost"
#   "safefetch: an SSRF-safe HTTP client for fetching recipe pages"
# A package or area prefix ("safefetch:", "Import:") is fine when it helps;
# there are no type prefixes like feat: or fix:.
#
# Body, wrapped at 72: WHY the change is needed and what someone using
# Sous will notice. Skip what the diff already makes obvious. Name any
# decision a reviewer should weigh, and anything not verified.
#
# Trailers last (Co-Authored-By: …), after a blank line.
#
# To use this template: git config commit.template .gitmessage
